{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "TSP Solver API",
    "description": "Travelling Salesman Problem Solver — REST API.\n\nThe collection is organised as a **typical workflow**:\n1. Fetch the `cities10` problem\n2. Solve with `nearest-neighbor`\n3. Solve with `greedy-edge`\n4. Improve the `greedy-edge` result with `2opt`\n5. Benchmark all three results\n\nEach request is independent and can be run on its own.\nChange the `base_url` collection variable to point at a different host.\n\nProblem types: `citiesN` (8–30), `circle-N` (3–1000), `cluster-N` (3–1000), `partially-randomN` (1–1000), `fully-randomN` (1–1000), `tsplib-<name>` (72 TSPLIB95 EUC_2D benchmarks, e.g. `tsplib-berlin52`, `tsplib-eil51`)\nResolution strategies: `brute-force` (max 12 cities), `random`, `random10`, `random100`, `nearest-neighbor`, `greedy-edge`\nImprovement strategies: `2opt`, `oropt`, `sa`, `uncrossing`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL of the running API server"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 — List available problem types",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/problem-types",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "problem-types"]
        },
        "description": "Returns all available TSPLIB95 EUC_2D benchmark names as full type strings (e.g. `tsplib-berlin52`). Use any returned name directly with `GET /api/problems/{type}`."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/problem-types",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "problem-types"]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "body": "{\n  \"tsplibTypes\": [\n    \"tsplib-berlin52\",\n    \"tsplib-bier127\",\n    \"tsplib-eil51\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 — Fetch problem (cities10)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/problems/cities10",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "problems",
            "cities10"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Retrieve the pre-built `cities10` Euclidean problem as a list of 10 2D points.\n\nOther valid types: `cities8`–`cities30`, `circle-3`–`circle-1000`, `cluster-3`–`cluster-1000`, `fully-random1`–`fully-random1000`, `partially-random1`–`partially-random1000`, `euclidean`, `tsplib-<name>` (e.g. `tsplib-berlin52`, `tsplib-kroA100`).\n\nNon-Euclidean types (`trivial`, `simple`, `bigger`) return 400."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/problems/cities10",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
