        "description": "Improve the greedy-edge tour from request 3 using 2-opt.\n\n2-opt iteratively reverses sub-segments of the route to eliminate crossing edges.\nPass the `route` and `totalDistance` from the previous solve response in `solution`.\n\nOther improvement strategies: `oropt`, `sa`, `uncrossing`\n\n`uncrossing` only works on Euclidean problems (it is equivalent to crossing-edge elimination)."
      },
      "response": [
        {
