        "description": "Rank the three results collected from requests 2, 3, and 4.\n\nPaste the `totalDistance` and `durationMs` from each previous response.\n`label` is a free-form string — use whatever is meaningful to you.\n\nThe response sorts by distance ascending. `gapPercent` shows how much worse each result is compared to the best (rank 1 always has `gapPercent: 0.0`).\n\nThis endpoint performs no computation — it is a pure ranking operation."
